\item[S2] A. Bolsinov, V. S. Matveev, E. Miranda and S. Tabachnikov, Open Problems, Questions, and Challenges in Finite-Dimensional Integrable Systems (2018), arXiv:1804.03737, Problem 3.1, table, and Conjectures 3.2–3.4. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.03737}.
